display_long_description:
Titan Isles is an action-adventure game demanding movement, improvisation & precision under pressure. Master five distinct Exo Suits, upgrade your abilities, and take down colossal Titans!

# FIVE WAYS TO PLAY
Select from five unique Exo Suits, each with distinct movement styles, weapons, and abilities. It feels like playing five different games! Swap suits between missions to experiment with new ways to move and fight.

{766913166425460}

# HUNT THE TITANS
Face immense, world-shaping Titans that dominate the battlefield. Learn to read their attacks, stay mobile, and find creative openings to strike back. Defeating each Titan unlocks powerful upgrades and reveals more of the mystery behind their awakening.

{1384909409981626}

# PLAY SOLO OR IN CO-OP
Show off your Titan-slaying skills in single player or in drop-in, drop-out co-op with up to four players. Missions, enemies, and rewards scale dynamically to match your team’s size and coordination.

{902415172961482}

# FIGHT ACROSS A FRACTURED WORLD
Traverse the floating ruins of Titan Isles - from jungle canopies and molten caverns to storm-torn cliffs and frozen peaks. Each biome offers new traversal challenges, hidden rewards waiting to be discovered.

{2016508809170455}

# TEST YOUR SPEED IN COMPETITIVE RACING
Put your Exo Suit skills to the test in racing minigames. Compete with friends & players for the top of the leaderboards!

{1623896788960397}

